WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.213 --> 00:00:18.245
"So Odd is a good guy now?"

2
00:00:18.665 --> 00:00:20.427
Terrell asked on the way back to Groon.

3
00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:22.509
Roxy nodded.

4
00:00:22.529 --> 00:00:25.932
"You were right—people can change."

5
00:00:27.052 --> 00:00:27.953
Wukong laughed.

6
00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:30.996
"I could have told you that!

7
00:00:31.408 --> 00:00:33.129
I used to be totally evil!"

8
00:00:33.149 --> 00:00:37.130
"This mission sounds dangerous," Terrell said.

9
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:42.251
"I think I'll call myself Danger Dude."

10
00:00:42.431 --> 00:00:44.732
"Superhero, you!"

11
00:00:45.052 --> 00:00:45.692
Bippo said.

12
00:00:46.853 --> 00:00:47.613
Roxy laughed.

13
00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:50.274
"Good name, Terrell!"

14
00:00:54.455 --> 00:00:55.635
Back on Groon, Dr.

15
00:00:55.715 --> 00:00:58.336
Odd gave Terrell a map that showed the computer's location.

16
00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.242
Then he gave him a slip of paper with something written on it.

17
00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:06.105
"You must type in this code," Dr.

18
00:01:06.205 --> 00:01:06.665
Odd said.

19
00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:11.088
Terrell nodded, and everybody clipped on communication devices.

20
00:01:12.529 --> 00:01:13.530
Dr. Odd smiled.

21
00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:15.071
"Good luck!"

22
00:01:17.912 --> 00:01:18.753
The group left Dr.

23
00:01:18.853 --> 00:01:20.434
Odd's moon and went down the tunnel.

24
00:01:23.456 --> 00:01:24.417
Everything was quiet.

25
00:01:24.437 --> 00:01:28.079
"Where are the robots?"

26
00:01:30.092 --> 00:01:30.432
Cozlin whispered.

27
00:01:30.452 --> 00:01:31.973
"I don't know," Roxy said.

28
00:01:31.993 --> 00:01:35.055
"But I'm sure they're around here somewhere."

29
00:01:37.776 --> 00:01:39.277
They passed through the energy shield.

30
00:01:41.378 --> 00:01:42.539
Roxy took a deep breath.

31
00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:48.622
Without their powers, they had no way to fight the robots until Terrell typed in that code.

32
00:01:49.763 --> 00:01:50.904
Even Bippo shut down.

33
00:01:53.945 --> 00:01:55.506
They soon reached a fork in the tunnel.

34
00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:58.468
Terrell looked at the map.

35
00:01:59.664 --> 00:02:00.705
"I have to go this way."

36
00:02:01.225 --> 00:02:02.205
Roxy bit her lip.

37
00:02:02.225 --> 00:02:04.647
"What if Terrell gets hurt?"

38
00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:05.547
she thought.

39
00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.568
"Maybe I should go with him."

40
00:02:09.369 --> 00:02:10.570
Cozlin saw her hesitate.

41
00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:13.872
"It's a simple job, Roxy.

42
00:02:14.152 --> 00:02:15.093
Terrell can do it.

43
00:02:16.113 --> 00:02:19.815
We need to keep going to find Meltron—before it's too late."

44
00:02:20.716 --> 00:02:21.396
Roxy nodded.

45
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:24.138
"Just move quickly, Terrell.

46
00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.559
Type in the code and go back to Dr.

47
00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:28.360
Odd's moon."

48
00:02:29.676 --> 00:02:31.017
He nodded back and hurried off.

49
00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.501
Roxy, Cozlin, and Wukong went deeper into Groon.

50
00:02:39.662 --> 00:02:41.603
Roxy heard a footstep clang behind her.

51
00:02:41.623 --> 00:02:43.524
"A robot!"

52
00:02:44.845 --> 00:02:48.047
She, Cozlin, and Wukong hid as the robot walked past.

53
00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:53.870
Wukong said.

54
00:02:55.191 --> 00:02:56.892
The group hurried farther down the tunnel.

55
00:02:57.972 --> 00:03:00.854
As they went deeper into the planet, the air grew hotter.

56
00:03:02.334 --> 00:03:05.156
"We're near the planet's core," Cozlin said.

57
00:03:05.176 --> 00:03:08.178
"Meltron must be close."

58
00:03:11.259 --> 00:03:13.260
Finally they reached a huge metal door.

59
00:03:14.441 --> 00:03:15.962
The letter M was stamped into it.

60
00:03:15.982 --> 00:03:18.883
"This is it," Roxy thought.

61
00:03:18.903 --> 00:03:21.685
"Meltron is behind this door."

62
00:03:23.026 --> 00:03:24.426
Wukong stepped up to the door.

63
00:03:24.447 --> 00:03:27.965
"Don't try to open it yet," Cozlin said.

64
00:03:27.985 --> 00:03:30.226
"We don't have our powers."

65
00:03:31.287 --> 00:03:33.348
Suddenly several robots appeared behind them.

66
00:03:34.249 --> 00:03:35.350
Cozlin spun around.

67
00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.731
"We're trapped!"

68
00:03:39.573 --> 00:03:40.814
"Crush them!"

69
00:03:41.174 --> 00:03:41.974
a robot shouted.

70
00:03:46.237 --> 00:03:48.339
Terrell heard the clang of footsteps approaching.

71
00:03:49.419 --> 00:03:51.641
He squeezed himself into a crack in the metal wall.

72
00:03:53.022 --> 00:03:55.644
He kept perfectly still until the last robot was gone.

73
00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.241
He sighed with relief and continued to the computer room.

74
00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:07.745
He looked at the glowing screen and began to type.

75
00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:14.189
Wukong took his iron bar out of his ear.

76
00:04:14.209 --> 00:04:19.091
"I wish we had a way to fight these—" Suddenly the bar grew, hitting Cozlin.

77
00:04:19.672 --> 00:04:21.213
"Ouch!" Cozlin said.

78
00:04:21.233 --> 00:04:24.454
"Sorry!" Wukong said.

79
00:04:24.474 --> 00:04:27.356
"But we have our powers back!"

80
00:04:30.044 --> 00:04:31.044
"Awake, me!"

81
00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:32.185
Bippo said.

82
00:04:33.105 --> 00:04:35.626
Terrell's voice came through Roxy's communication device.

83
00:04:35.646 --> 00:04:37.366
"Did it work?"

84
00:04:37.386 --> 00:04:39.447
"Yes, Terrell!"

85
00:04:39.687 --> 00:04:40.387
Roxy shouted.

86
00:04:40.407 --> 00:04:42.107
"You did it!"

87
00:04:42.127 --> 00:04:44.708
"Yes!" Terrell said.

88
00:04:44.728 --> 00:04:48.249
Wukong swung the bar.

89
00:04:48.889 --> 00:04:51.710
Crunch! Robots smashed into pieces.

90
00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:55.371
Spinning around, he struck more robots.

91
00:04:56.111 --> 00:04:57.972
Soon they all lay on the floor, lifeless.

92
00:04:59.088 --> 00:05:00.750
Sparks and smoke filled the tunnel.

93
00:05:03.052 --> 00:05:03.933
Wukong laughed.

94
00:05:04.754 --> 00:05:05.775
"That was fun!"

95
00:05:07.678 --> 00:05:09.439
Roxy grabbed the door and forced it open.
